Dialogue: 3,0:22:37.84,0:22:40.38,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}櫻花凋零  片片飛舞
Dialogue: 3,0:22:40.38,0:22:44.09,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}我永遠在苦苦等待
Dialogue: 3,0:22:44.09,0:22:47.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}渴望得到你的溫暖
Dialogue: 3,0:22:48.31,0:22:51.06,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}我最討厭流下眼淚
Dialogue: 3,0:22:51.06,0:22:54.31,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}生怕被人看出悲傷
Dialogue: 3,0:22:54.31,0:22:57.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}將它深深鎖在體內
Dialogue: 3,0:22:58.48,0:22:59.02,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC9E8B&\blur6\bord1.5}快了，
Dialogue: 3,0:22:59.02,0:23:01.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC9E8B&\blur6\bord1.5}櫻花凋零  片片飛舞
